## Technical Challenges

Some of the main challenges during development included:

- Understanding how QLoRA combines quantization with LoRA adapters.
- Preparing conversational datasets for instruction tuning.
- Configuring efficient training pipelines while working within limited GPU resources.
- Monitoring training performance and preventing overfitting.

